# Point the UI at the read-only API (waystone3 api-serve, default port 9200).
# Local FastAPI. The Next.js dev server proxies /api/* here so the browser only
# talks to the UI origin (port 3001). Needed for Cursor port-forward / remote preview.
# For IBKR KPIs, the API needs IBKR_REPORTS_LOCAL_DIR or IBKR_REPORTS_BUCKET — see docs/IBKR_DAILY.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:9200
